message: "If you use or reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Aletheia — Plurality Audit for Synthetic Governance Threads"
abstract: >-
  Aletheia is a methodological portfolio project in AI Safety and
  applied epistemology. It proposes a plurality audit: a way to measure
  the gap between the apparent plurality of voices in a governance
  thread and the real plurality of conceptually distinct positions
  expressed. The project demonstrates how to formulate, preregister,
  test, and report a falsifiable hypothesis about epistemic review aids,
  with explicit baselines, ablation, kill criteria, and declared
  limitations.
